battery_device.description:
Keeps an old iPad's battery between the start and stop levels by switching its charger plug, instead of charging 24/7.

Readings are asked for over MQTT, which keeps the screen off. Only a panel that doesn't answer is woken by switching the charger on, then put back to sleep (with the kiosk tweak installed, the chime is muted while it's locked). If it still doesn't answer, the charger stays on as a fail-safe.

